---
source: crates/cli/tests/native.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
Generate UUIDs: random (v4) or time-ordered (v7)

Usage: tw uuid [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --v4          Random (the default)
      --v7          Time-ordered: starts with the time, so it sorts by creation
  -n, --count <N>   How many UUIDs to generate
  -u, --upper       Write the hex digits in uppercase
      --json        Write the result as JSON
      --no-newline  Do not end text output with a newline
  -h, --help        Print help
